    "featuredAlt": "No, Jessie Isn’t Crazy (I Can Prove It.)",
    "text": "Hi! I’m Ipo, the little pink science dog Jessie tells you about at the farmers market. If he sent you here, it’s probably because you were thinking: “This man in the white shirt, swim trunks, and Crocs sounds insane.”\nSo let me do my job: I can prove what Jessie says.\n\nYes — he really grows the fruit.\n\nLilikoi, papaya, spearmint, cranberry hibiscus, aloe — all grown on his land, picked in the morning, and dropped into ice baths to keep enzymes and antioxidants alive.\nThat’s why Fruity Puppy has 45% real fruit pulp, 17 bioavailable antioxidants, and intact polysaccharides protected by zero-heat extraction. This isn’t folklore — it’s controlled agriculture + food-grade chemistry.\n\nYes — the science is real.\n\nFruity Puppy uses probiotic preservation instead of chemicals, zero fillers, zero fragrance, zero synthetics, and live fruit compounds in a cold-process formula. It’s not lotion. It’s biochemistry.\n\nYes — the pink jars are preservation chambers.\n\nThey protect enzymes, antioxidants, polysaccharides, and the probiotic system. That’s why the results happen fast — fruit doesn’t just moisturize, it repairs.\n\nSo no, Jessie isn’t crazy. He’s early.\n\nAnd everything he told you? I can prove it. Come talk to me on the website — that’s what he built me for. 🐾✨"
