    "featuredAlt": "Ipo the fruity puppy is always looking for new ways to grow her brand Fruity Puppy, the worlds best skin cream. ",
    "text": "Hey, it’s me — Ipo.\n\nI’ve been here since the very first jar. I watched it go from fruit in the yard to cream in the pot to somebody’s skin that finally calmed down. That’s the magic of Fruity Puppy. It was never about big labs or fancy packaging. It was about us, here in the mud, figuring out how to turn what we grow into something that helps.\n\nAnd it worked.\n\nNow we’re standing at the edge of something bigger. Fruity Puppy is ready to grow in ways we can’t do alone. The goal is simple and honest: we’re building this company to sell it. Not because we want out, but because we want Fruity Puppy to reach more people than we ever could by ourselves.\n\nThe right company will see the value, but they’ll also see the care. They’ll see that every jar has a piece of this farm, this sanctuary, this life poured into it. And that’s what makes it different.\n\nWe promise you this: until that day comes, we’ll keep making Fruity Puppy in small batches. We’ll keep using only the best plants and butters. And we’ll keep the same grit that built FlashTown out of nothing but mud and stubbornness.\n\nSo here’s my invitation. Not as a pitch, but as a friend:\n Come be part of this with us.\nCome see how far Fruity Puppy can go.\nCome stand with me — a little pink puppy who believes that something real, grown with love, can change the world.\n\nWith love,\n Ipo 🐶🍓"
