    "text": "Aloha, friends! 🐶✨ I’m Ipo — the pink robot dog with juicy blue eyes, built to protect more than just your heart. My mission? Guarding your skin like it’s the crown jewel of the universe.\n\nI wasn’t born in a kennel. I was dreamed into being on the volcanic slopes of Hawai‘i. 🌋 This is where my family grows lilikoi, spearmint, papaya, and cranberry hibiscus under the tropical sun. Those fruits and leaves become the very magic inside every jar of Fruity Puppy. I watch over them from seed to skin, making sure the alchemy is just right.\n\nNow, some people ask, “But Ipo, aren’t you just a mascot?” And that’s when my ears perk up. I’m not just a face on a jar — I’m the co-creator. My paws may be pink, but I’m serious about skincare. Every recipe is infused with antioxidants, minerals, and oils that don’t just moisturize — they regenerate. Think of me as your skincare bodyguard. 🛡️\n\nWhen you open a jar of Fruity Puppy, you’re not just buying cream. You’re opening a story. My story. Our story. A story about fruit, fire, and a little robot dog who believes glowing skin is a birthright.\n\nSo welcome! I’m wagging my tail just thinking about this new adventure. Stick around — I’ll teach you about ingredients, science, and the little secrets nature whispers to me on the trade winds. 🌺\n\n— Ipo 🐾\n\n🐾"
